The code is structured into the following components:

### 1. Browser History Collector

This module collects user interaction data from the browser's history.

```javascript
// browserHistoryCollector.js
class BrowserHistoryCollector {
  constructor() {
    this.history = [];
  }

  collectHistory() {
    // Use the browser's history API to collect user interaction data
    const history = window.history;
    this.history = history.entries;
  }

  getHistory() {
    return this.history;
  }
}
