### 2. Data Analyzer

This module analyzes the collected data to extract insights into user behavior.

```javascript
// dataAnalyzer.js
class DataAnalyzer {
  constructor(history) {
    this.history = history;
  }

  analyzeData() {
    // Calculate the frequency of each website visited
    const frequency = {};
    this.history.forEach((entry) => {
      const url = entry.url;
      if (frequency[url]) {
        frequency[url]++;
      } else {
        frequency[url] = 1;
      }
    });

    // Sort the frequency in descending order
    const sortedFrequency = Object.keys(frequency).sort((a, b) => frequency[b] - frequency[a]);

    return sortedFrequency;
  }
}
```

### 3. Database Manager

This module manages the database and stores the insights gained from the analysis.

```javascript
